" alt="Path warden Hasan ibn Salim corrected battle portrait"><button class="zoom" type="button">Enlarge portrait</button></article><article data-faction="Dawn Bloom"><h2>Path warden Yusuf ibn Salim</h2><p class="faction">Dawn Bloom</p><img class="portrait" src="data:image/webp;base64," data-original="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Path warden Yusuf ibn Salim corrected battle portrait"><button class="zoom" type="button">Enlarge portrait</button></article><article data-faction="Dawn Bloom"><h2>Path warden Maryam bint Salim</h2><p class="faction">Dawn Bloom</p><img class="portrait" src="data:image/webp;base64," data-original="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Path warden Maryam bint Salim corrected battle portrait"><button class="zoom" type="button">Enlarge portrait</button></article><article data-faction="Dawn Bloom"><h2>Path warden Aisha bint Salim</h2><p class="faction">Dawn Bloom</p><img class="portrait" src="data:image/webp;base64," data-original="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Path warden Aisha bint Salim corrected battle portrait"><button class="zoom" type="button">Enlarge portrait</button></article><article data-faction="Dawn Bloom"><h2>Path warden Ali ibn Salim</h2><p class="faction">Dawn Bloom</p><img class="portrait" src="data:image/webp;base64," data-original="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Path warden Ali ibn Salim corrected battle portrait"><button class="zoom" type="button">Enlarge portrait</button></article><article data-faction="Dawn Bloom"><h2>Path warden Hafsa bint Salim</h2><p class="faction">Dawn Bloom</p><img class="portrait" src="data:image/webp;base64," data-original="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Path warden Hafsa bint Salim corrected battle portrait"><button class="zoom" type="button">Enlarge portrait</button></article><article data-faction="Dawn Bloom"><h2>Path warden Salim ibn Salim</h2><p class="faction">Dawn Bloom</p><img class="portrait" src="data:image/webp;base64," data-original="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Path warden Salim ibn Salim corrected battle portrait"><button class="zoom" type="button">Enlarge portrait</button></article><article data-faction="Dawn Bloom"><h2>Path warden Hasan ibn Ali</h2><p class="faction">Dawn Bloom</p><img class="portrait" src="data:image/webp;base64," data-original="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Path warden Hasan ibn Ali corrected battle portrait"><button class="zoom" type="button">Enlarge portrait</button></article></main><footer><p>49 individual corrections made with built-in image generation using the existing trainer art as the reference. Transparent battle portraits retain individual clothing and equipment, with complete framing and visible equipment support.</p></footer><dialog id="viewer"><img alt="Enlarged trainer portrait"><button id="close">Close</button></dialog><script>const pics=[...document.querySelectorAll('.portrait')],corrected=new Map(pics.map(p=>[p,p.src]));let original=false;document.querySelector('#compare').onclick=e=>{original=!original;pics.forEach(p=>p.src=original?p.dataset.original:corrected.get(p));e.target.textContent=original?'Show corrected portraits':'Show original portraits';e.target.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(original));document.querySelector('#status').textContent=original?'Showing original portraits':'Showing corrected portraits'};document.querySelector('#filter').onchange=e=>document.querySelectorAll('article').forEach(c=>c.hidden=e.target.value!=='All trainers'&&c.dataset.faction!==e.target.value);document.querySelectorAll('.zoom').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const p=b.parentElement.querySelector('img'),v=document.querySelector('#viewer');v.querySelector('img').src=p.src;v.querySelector('img').alt=p.alt;v.showModal()});document.querySelector('#close').onclick=()=>document.querySelector('#viewer').close();</script></body></html>